      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-03-08T03:01:38.454Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This week is another Ultimate matchup of Ambuscade vs. Luminary, Super Scientific Tachyon, Omnitron-X, Rogue Agent K.N.Y.F.E., and Freedom Five Bunker fighting in the Omnitron-IV facility! As suggested by the title, lots of Devices here from many sources. I recommend fishing for All According to Plan as soon as you can, even though it’ll make thing hurt worse for the heroes. Luminary can probably cycle through his deck a couple times with all the deck manipulation powers here. I got off a Death Ray shot for 24, and had a horde of boosted Devices that could slash and burn right through the 1 DR on Ambuscade’s front side. I think it ended by about the 3rd, maybe 4th round.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e\" title=\"20230307215225_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20230307215225_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"vRa5TdJySY1tZ29iaQwJBJAAabY\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/df45d58ea8486ddeecd3b9a3df5bbcd74eaaf74e_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20230307215225_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 359 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
