      "created_at": "2023-03-08T13:49:25.839Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I have a feeling this one might be pseudo-random, considering all the shuffling Ambuscade does.</p>\n<p>I was able to Mint, but it took a little extra effort because I wasn’t paying close attention to Luminary’s deck and he reshuffled before I could do a laser. D: Easy to get him back into lasering range, but <em>still.</em></p>",
