      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-03-14T22:35:23.142Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Now that Ambuscade is making a repeat appearance this week, I can finally get around to putting my experiences in here.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vgkwFeac8eWUixEqBIFtHx406L1\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/d/db1bfc8c122b5cd5f8f743d9db42315cb2e2e6db_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 110 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nI waited just one turn too long charging up the Orbital Death-Laser to take out Ambuscade. And then he brought out the armageddon inducing Charged Attacks and blew up everything in a 12 block radius. When the dust settled, Ambuscade had knocked himself down to 4 health but still limped away the victor.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eWmNQanzHMwFvXyFWt3B70LJzua\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/68b78000ec5b4d71d9dfd0cc266683498a1d3da2_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 109 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nStill had Charged Attacks hit pretty hard in this one, but there were survivors afterward and after two shots from the Orbital Death-Laser, Ambuscade finally went down.</p>\n<p>Not sure if I’m looking forward to redemption this week or dreading an even meaner version of our not-so-favourite French hunter.</p>",
