      "raw": "Now that Ambuscade is making a repeat appearance this week, I can finally get around to putting my experiences in here.\n![image|231x500](upload://vgkwFeac8eWUixEqBIFtHx406L1.jpeg)\nI waited just one turn too long charging up the Orbital Death-Laser to take out Ambuscade. And then he brought out the armageddon inducing Charged Attacks and blew up everything in a 12 block radius. When the dust settled, Ambuscade had knocked himself down to 4 health but still limped away the victor.\n![image|231x500](upload://eWmNQanzHMwFvXyFWt3B70LJzua.jpeg)\nStill had Charged Attacks hit pretty hard in this one, but there were survivors afterward and after two shots from the Orbital Death-Laser, Ambuscade finally went down.\n\nNot sure if I'm looking forward to redemption this week or dreading an even meaner version of our not-so-favourite French hunter.",
